mitodo is a fork of eilmeldung
    https://github.com/christo-auer/eilmeldung
    Copyright (C) christo-auer
    Licensed GPL-3.0-or-later

eilmeldung is a TUI RSS reader built on the news-flash library. mitodo was
created by forking it at version 1.1.0 and replacing the RSS layer with a store
over markdown todo files. The full commit history of eilmeldung is preserved in
this repository, and `git remote add upstream
https://github.com/christo-auer/eilmeldung` tracks the original.

What mitodo inherits from eilmeldung, in whole or in substantial part:

  src/config/theme.rs   the colour palette, style set and theming model,
                        used essentially unchanged
  src/input/mod.rs      the terminal input reader loop
  src/ui/view.rs        the overall screen layout: top bar, three panes,
                        command line, status row
  src/ui/chyron.rs      the scrolling ticker concept and its scroll state
                        machine, reimplemented for todo items

What was written for mitodo rather than ported:

  src/store/            markdown parsing, the conflict-aware writer, workspace
                        detection and loading, the filesystem watcher
  src/query/            the query language, parser and matcher
  src/agent/            the external-agent pipeline and change-set application
  src/ui/mod.rs         the application state and event loop
  src/git.rs            git sync

